1
00:00:40,869 --> 00:00:46,203
=My Loong=

2
00:00:46,203 --> 00:00:48,698
=Episode 5=

3
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:41,599
Young lady, come take a look!

4
00:01:45,197 --> 00:01:46,656
Fortune-telling!

5
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:49,879
Care for a reading, Master?

6
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,000
No?

7
00:01:52,187 --> 00:01:53,445
Fortune-telling!

8
00:02:00,502 --> 00:02:01,715
Take a look!

9
00:02:04,359 --> 00:02:07,760
Steamed buns! Fresh out of the steamer!

10
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:09,960
Out of the way! Move!

11
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:12,560
Boss, when are you paying
this month's 30 copper coins?

12
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,960
Up again?

13
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:16,639
I said 30, so 30 it is!

14
00:02:17,159 --> 00:02:19,199
The Qingloong Gang
is doing you a courtesy.

15
00:02:19,759 --> 00:02:22,400
Master, meat prices
went up three times already.

16
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,560
And you are...

17
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:26,159
What blind fool dares steal food?

18
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,400
- You're seeking death!
- You're seeking death!

19
00:02:37,599 --> 00:02:38,599
Let's go.

20
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,439
- You just wait!
- You just wait!

21
00:02:42,439 --> 00:02:43,439
Just you wait!

22
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:46,400
You didn't pay either!

23
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:52,000
Wine is poison that rots the gut,

24
00:02:52,479 --> 00:02:55,000
lust is a blade that scrapes the bone,

25
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,680
wealth is the root of misfortune,

26
00:02:57,680 --> 00:03:00,840
and anger is gunpowder ready to blow.

27
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:04,759
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

28
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,680
In this world of ours,

29
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:09,000
the hardest thing to read
is the human heart.

30
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:10,960
Why?

31
00:03:11,319 --> 00:03:14,240
Pretty women are notoriously fickle.

32
00:03:15,008 --> 00:03:16,110
Dear audience,

33
00:03:16,110 --> 00:03:19,479
have you heard
of a family here in Qinghe County?

34
00:03:19,719 --> 00:03:22,120
The man was honest and upright,

35
00:03:22,479 --> 00:03:24,120
yet plain and unsightly,

36
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:26,960
but he ended up with a stunning wife.

37
00:03:27,479 --> 00:03:31,719
His wife had willow brows
and almond eyes,

38
00:03:31,719 --> 00:03:33,360
a delicate cherry-red pout,

39
00:03:33,639 --> 00:03:35,560
a waist slender as a brush stem,

40
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:37,639
and a voice sweet as an oriole.

41
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:39,840
However, she felt wronged,

42
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,199
couldn't bear the loneliness,

43
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:44,879
and had an affair
with a wealthy playboy.

44
00:03:44,879 --> 00:03:48,120
She colluded in secret
with Master Ximen,

45
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:50,479
fickle in her affections

46
00:03:50,479 --> 00:03:54,199
and utterly promiscuous!

47
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:58,919
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

48
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,120
Master,

49
00:04:03,159 --> 00:04:04,520
you're listening so intently.

50
00:04:04,599 --> 00:04:06,159
Did you happen to meet such a woman?

51
00:04:06,879 --> 00:04:08,199
She isn't having an affair,

52
00:04:08,759 --> 00:04:11,240
but she's afraid of me...

53
00:04:24,160 --> 00:04:25,560
- Why did he just walk off?
- Hey, he...

54
00:04:27,439 --> 00:04:29,759
Make way!

55
00:04:30,199 --> 00:04:31,279
Thank you! Make way!

56
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,120
Move! Make way!

57
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:49,600
These are top-grade goods
for Chunfeng Pavilion.

58
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,319
If they break, I'm done for.

59
00:04:56,519 --> 00:05:00,199
Tell me. Normally,
people wouldn't be afraid, right?

60
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:21,240
You're fine, just a bit shaken
from a few days ago.

61
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:23,199
You are recovering very well.

62
00:05:24,199 --> 00:05:26,079
Don't be so reckless again.

63
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,879
Look out for yourself first.

64
00:05:32,399 --> 00:05:34,720
Wangshu, tell me the truth.

65
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:38,480
Will the Loong Lord really let you
stay in the mortal realm?

66
00:05:39,720 --> 00:05:40,720
Of course.

67
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,279
Would I lie to you?

68
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:52,600
Wangshu, I don't want you to suffer.

69
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,160
Let's run away, okay?

70
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,959
To the ends of the earth.

71
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,120
He's the Loong Lord.

72
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:01,480
Where could we possibly run?

73
00:06:05,279 --> 00:06:06,839
We will run,

74
00:06:08,399 --> 00:06:09,399
just not right now.

75
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,439
Then I'll go to the Young Lord.

76
00:06:11,759 --> 00:06:12,839
He's royalty after all.

77
00:06:12,839 --> 00:06:13,839
He must have a way.

78
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,079
If he had any backbone,

79
00:06:15,639 --> 00:06:16,839
I wouldn't be in this mess.

80
00:06:18,079 --> 00:06:20,120
Loongs may think differently
from mortals,

81
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,879
yet they would never make grand excuses

82
00:06:22,879 --> 00:06:24,199
to do vile things.

83
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,360
Don't worry.

84
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,800
Wangshu, is that you?

85
00:06:29,639 --> 00:06:30,639
Is it really you?

86
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,000
Wangshu.

87
00:06:35,079 --> 00:06:36,079
You're not dead.

88
00:06:36,959 --> 00:06:38,839
You're still alive. Thank goodness!

89
00:06:42,279 --> 00:06:43,279
Let's speak in private.

90
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:00,639
Keep it down. Don't let him hear us.

91
00:07:07,959 --> 00:07:09,879
- Go.
- Go.

92
00:07:10,199 --> 00:07:11,199
That's him!

93
00:07:11,319 --> 00:07:12,319
He took a steamer of buns

94
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,800
and paid nothing!

95
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:15,480
My paintings, my hard work,
my best wares!

96
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,480
He took a bunch of them!

97
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:19,160
- You go first.
- I say we go together.

98
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:21,199
- You go.
- No, you go.

99
00:07:21,199 --> 00:07:23,079
- Hurry!
- Let's go together.

100
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:28,160
You should head back.

101
00:07:28,759 --> 00:07:31,040
Wangshu, I wanted to save you!

102
00:07:31,399 --> 00:07:33,319
I just couldn't tell you the plan
back then.

103
00:07:33,959 --> 00:07:35,360
Your aunt has been very kind to me.

104
00:07:35,759 --> 00:07:36,759
How could I...

105
00:07:37,079 --> 00:07:38,839
Can't you show me
even a bit understanding?

106
00:07:44,279 --> 00:07:45,279
Zhu Heng,

107
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,839
do you feel that I've wronged you?

108
00:07:49,279 --> 00:07:50,680
That's not what I mean.

109
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:54,959
I... I just wanted you
to understand my predicament.

110
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:56,839
I sent men to rescue you.

111
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,680
Doesn't that prove my feelings for you?

112
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,439
Now that I rescued you,

113
00:08:00,959 --> 00:08:02,120
and not even show gratitude?

114
00:08:02,439 --> 00:08:03,800
You rescued me?

115
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,680
Show gratitude?

116
00:08:07,839 --> 00:08:11,240
My men failed to reach you in time,

117
00:08:11,759 --> 00:08:13,000
but to save you...

118
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:15,959
I... To save you,

119
00:08:15,959 --> 00:08:17,399
I bribed every guard nearby.

120
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:20,000
That was why they were reassigned.

121
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,959
Otherwise, how could you
have reached here safely?

122
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:28,000
So, Your Highness, you intended

123
00:08:28,199 --> 00:08:29,600
to keep me hidden from the world,

124
00:08:30,199 --> 00:08:32,720
marry Yue Lingluo with grand fanfare,

125
00:08:33,799 --> 00:08:36,480
while professing your helplessness
to me,

126
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:38,919
and keeping me outside as a concubine?

127
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,879
Even a concubine has a title.

128
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,039
I would have no name or standing,

129
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:47,159
forced into hiding forever
because I fled in secret,

130
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:49,240
living the rest of my days
under your thumb,

131
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:52,120
and I'm supposed to thank you
and be grateful for your charity?

132
00:08:53,720 --> 00:08:55,159
How could you say that about me?

133
00:08:55,639 --> 00:08:57,039
I've done so much for you,

134
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:59,960
yet you make it sound so despicable.

135
00:09:00,159 --> 00:09:01,159
Despicable?

136
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:05,360
No, Your Highness.
You've certainly planned this well.

137
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:07,279
You preserve your reputation,

138
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,480
maintain your ties with the Yue family,

139
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,519
and can still keep me, a dead woman,

140
00:09:11,519 --> 00:09:12,519
as your secret lover,

141
00:09:12,799 --> 00:09:14,440
enjoying the best of both worlds.

142
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:16,559
How is that despicable?

143
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:20,360
It's the best deal on earth.

144
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:21,720
A pity, though,

145
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,399
you miscalculated.

146
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:27,960
I would rather drown

147
00:09:28,799 --> 00:09:30,399
than be kept as your secret lover.

148
00:09:31,519 --> 00:09:33,720
You... You are completely unreasonable!

149
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:36,960
No wonder you never got along
with the senior branch.

150
00:09:37,279 --> 00:09:39,480
I tried to mediate,
yet you always blamed me.

151
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:41,200
Qiyang once warned me

152
00:09:41,399 --> 00:09:42,440
that you were stubborn,

153
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:43,879
combative, and aggressive.

154
00:09:44,159 --> 00:09:45,159
I didn't believe it.

155
00:09:45,639 --> 00:09:48,039
Now I see he was right.

156
00:09:48,279 --> 00:09:50,120
My feelings for you
were completely sincere,

157
00:09:50,799 --> 00:09:53,240
yet you twist them into filthy schemes.

158
00:09:55,039 --> 00:09:56,200
Go back, Zhu Heng.

159
00:09:57,000 --> 00:10:00,240
Go on being the pampered young lord
shielded by everyone.

160
00:10:01,039 --> 00:10:03,960
From now on, we are strangers.

161
00:10:05,639 --> 00:10:08,600
Wangshu... Wangshu, come with me.

162
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,720
You must come with me!

163
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,480
Lizhi!

164
00:10:18,279 --> 00:10:19,279
Who are you?

165
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:21,840
He's a guard sent by the Loong Lord
to protect me.

166
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:23,639
Nonsense!

167
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,799
Do not believe such superstitions.

168
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:27,240
There's no Loong Lord.

169
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:28,600
Take him away,

170
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:29,840
and protect Lady Wangshu.

171
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,360
Lizhi!

172
00:10:43,799 --> 00:10:44,799
Hurry, go!

173
00:10:45,039 --> 00:10:47,159
Take your master and get lost
if you want to live!

174
00:10:50,279 --> 00:10:51,279
You're defending him?

175
00:11:25,759 --> 00:11:26,759
Go.

176
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,480
What's going on here?

177
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,120
Make way. Move aside.

178
00:11:37,552 --> 00:11:42,674
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

179
00:11:43,919 --> 00:11:45,279
Why didn't you let me kill him?

180
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:46,799
Wanting to kill someone

181
00:11:47,799 --> 00:11:49,279
means there's still hatred inside,

182
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,480
and lingering resentment.

183
00:11:52,639 --> 00:11:56,519
But now, he is nothing to me.

184
00:11:57,759 --> 00:11:59,360
How could I ever have thought

185
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:01,759
he was someone I could rely on?

186
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:03,600
Where did you all go?

187
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:04,840
Tell me!

188
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:06,159
We went to Mount Huang

189
00:12:06,159 --> 00:12:07,320
and Mount Liuli.

190
00:12:07,519 --> 00:12:08,559
We could even hunt there.

191
00:12:08,559 --> 00:12:09,559
It was so thrilling!

192
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:11,480
Take me with you!

193
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:14,200
I don't care! You have to take me!

194
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:16,960
Wangshu.

195
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:19,360
I missed you while away,

196
00:12:19,679 --> 00:12:22,679
so I painted the scenery for you.

197
00:12:23,799 --> 00:12:24,840
When you're not with me,

198
00:12:25,279 --> 00:12:28,120
I'll paint it all for you, okay?

199
00:12:29,559 --> 00:12:31,440
He used to give me many paintings,

200
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:33,960
some even made by his own hand,

201
00:12:34,399 --> 00:12:36,200
yet he never once took me along.

202
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,600
The only journey we ever took together

203
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:42,759
was when we eloped and got dragged back.

204
00:12:44,320 --> 00:12:46,320
And the first outside world
I ever saw...

205
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:55,679
Lizhi, stop!

206
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:56,840
You're stopping me?

207
00:12:58,440 --> 00:12:59,600
A woman concealing her past

208
00:13:00,080 --> 00:13:04,480
- must have something illicit to hide.
- What did you say?

209
00:13:04,480 --> 00:13:05,480
You not only protect him

210
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:06,840
and miss him,

211
00:13:07,399 --> 00:13:09,080
but you even take his side to order me.

212
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:11,919
So fickle,

213
00:13:11,919 --> 00:13:13,440
so unfaithful,

214
00:13:14,559 --> 00:13:20,919
truly loose and promiscuous.

215
00:13:23,879 --> 00:13:27,360
I... I was framed,

216
00:13:28,399 --> 00:13:29,480
slandered,

217
00:13:29,759 --> 00:13:31,000
and barely survived.

218
00:13:31,480 --> 00:13:33,240
We're just using each other
for our own ends.

219
00:13:33,759 --> 00:13:35,480
Why must you humiliate me like this?

220
00:13:37,759 --> 00:13:38,759
Want a bun?

221
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:40,399
No.

222
00:13:42,919 --> 00:13:45,320
Young lady, is this man with you?

223
00:13:46,159 --> 00:13:48,360
He took a whole steamer of buns
without paying.

224
00:13:48,360 --> 00:13:50,279
- And my jar of candy!
- And my paintings.

225
00:13:50,462 --> 00:13:51,938
- And my things!
- Mine too!

226
00:13:52,879 --> 00:13:53,879
This master here

227
00:13:54,159 --> 00:13:55,559
ordered several stories in a row,

228
00:13:55,759 --> 00:13:56,919
didn't leave a single tip,

229
00:13:56,919 --> 00:13:58,000
and just ran off!

230
00:14:01,159 --> 00:14:02,240
You listened to stories?

231
00:14:02,679 --> 00:14:03,919
Not just listening!

232
00:14:03,919 --> 00:14:05,080
He sat in our teahouse

233
00:14:05,559 --> 00:14:07,039
for two whole hours.

234
00:14:07,399 --> 00:14:09,919
He listened to the story
of a maiden scaling walls for love,

235
00:14:10,159 --> 00:14:11,679
a cruel man taking what wasn't his.

236
00:14:11,679 --> 00:14:13,360
My throat went dry reciting it all!

237
00:14:13,799 --> 00:14:16,559
I had just gotten
to the fickle, promiscuous beauty,

238
00:14:17,399 --> 00:14:18,399
and when I looked up,

239
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:20,960
he had already vanished!

240
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:23,039
Now I know where all your nonsense words

241
00:14:23,039 --> 00:14:24,240
came from.

242
00:14:24,799 --> 00:14:28,159
Lizhi, you really are
a one-of-a-kind genius.

243
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:33,080
I'm so sorry.

244
00:14:33,559 --> 00:14:34,600
Sorry.

245
00:14:39,679 --> 00:14:40,759
Thank you.

246
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:43,440
- Thanks.
- Thanks.

247
00:14:52,246 --> 00:14:56,821
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

248
00:14:57,596 --> 00:15:02,093
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

249
00:15:05,332 --> 00:15:10,454
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

250
00:15:10,454 --> 00:15:13,793
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

251
00:15:13,793 --> 00:15:15,157
♪Refusing to forget♪

252
00:15:18,823 --> 00:15:23,600
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

253
00:15:24,151 --> 00:15:25,941
♪He cannot learn them♪

254
00:15:25,941 --> 00:15:29,076
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

255
00:15:32,228 --> 00:15:34,552
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

256
00:15:34,552 --> 00:15:36,915
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

257
00:15:37,493 --> 00:15:40,157
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

258
00:15:40,157 --> 00:15:41,915
♪Their days ahead are long♪
